<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - VLSI Tech raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - VLSI Tech raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Salomon Brothers said analyst Erika Klauer upgraded VLSI Technology Inc to strong buy from hold.</p>
<p>-- said orders are improving, led by the communications markets, with lead times expanding.</p>
<p>-- said expects strong second quarter results due on July 16, and is confident that the company will meet or beat her earnings estimate of $0.23 per share.</p>
<p>-- shares gained 1-9/16 to 24-1/8.</p>
</text>
